      "description": "A Black woman with braided hair, wearing a white tank top, is holding a pregnancy test and looking distressed or confused, with one hand on her forehead. She appears to be in a bathroom or bedroom setting, with a towel on her head. The scene is framed to evoke a relatable, humorous moment of surprise or confusion, as indicated by the overlaid text describing a scenario involving pregnancy and tampon use.",
